flowchart LR
    subgraph Forward [Forward proxy represents clients]
      C[Client browser] -->|configured outbound request| FP[Forward proxy]
      FP -->|new request or CONNECT tunnel| Internet[Internet destination]
      Internet -->|response| FP
      FP --> C
    end
    subgraph Reverse [Reverse proxy represents services]
      Visitor[Visitor browser] -->|public HTTPS request| RP[Reverse proxy or edge]
      RP -->|route and balance| App1[Backend service A]
      RP -->|route and balance| App2[Backend service B]
      App1 --> RP
      App2 --> RP
      RP --> Visitor
    end